ed. Is this all it takes to drive you over the edge?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can't think of anything... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Time...Time is running out. We're gonna die here for sure... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's been three hours since we sent out the distress signal. S.F...will find us, then kill us..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Calm down, Negev. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We don't necessarily have to die just yet."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But...but my neural cloud is already... I... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I can't be of any help to you... I... Jericho, what should I do...? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How do I go back to my old self..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Jericho grips Negev's shoulders hard."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"THIS is you, Negev. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A weak, panicky, unopinionated piece of junk that relies on these Masks to survive. This is what you are. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So now you don't have a choice."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even if your neural cloud didn't pass the 【Test】, you must consume the Mask and leave this place alive."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You really want me to do that? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Jericho, I'm scared...I'm scared that after I consume it... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My neural cloud won't be able to handle it... I'll lose a lot of things..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What else do you have to lose?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A lot of memories. I... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll definitely forget you, Jericho. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The next time we meet, it'll be somewhere else, another version of you. And everything that happened here, everyone's memories of me will once again..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Jericho laughs, but starts coughing in pain immediately."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why must you remember me...? Cough... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Cough... I'm a bastard...Negev... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's a good thing you didn't pass the test. You should forget all about me, the way everyone did... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is what I deserve... The price for what I want...is way too high. It shouldn't be yours to pay..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But...but I...couldn't help you at all... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Can't we both die together and just wait for Griffin to recover our bodies?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Never give up a chance of survival. Hold onto it. For me... That's an order... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Consume this and live on...for me... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Leave behind everything that's happened here... That's it. That's the price you have to pay..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Will I...ever be able to get it back...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humph... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You idiot... Don't you still owe me an ending? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You have to come back. I never let anyone owe me anything..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"When this story...this pathetic lie has an ending... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You'll remember me..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I will... I..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Omm... Omm..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"......"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AAAAAAARGHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Jericho","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"When this story...this pathetic lie has an ending... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You'll remember me... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then we'll meet again. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Go, Negev. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Be the person that you are, and live. Until next time, when we meet each other for real."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MicroUZI","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"作战室avg","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"Micro Uzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, why has our vagrant ladyship gone quiet?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NEGEV","expression":0,"shown":true,"side"