ion. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If today was to be your last day... If it's gonna be over for you today, what would you do?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Negev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's been a while, Jericho. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is how the story ends... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Do you like it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Episode 7 Night Battle ⁠— Incomplete Memory END"}]}]}]}
